cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "structure-placebo: placebo controls for structure-aware metaheuristics"
abstract: >-
  Implementation of two controls that test whether a structural score in a
  population-based optimizer carries search-relevant information: permutation
  of the score across nodes, and randomisation of an adaptive selection rule.
  Includes the audit protocol, the statistical machinery, and the study data.
authors:
  - name: "Anonymous Author"
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/anonymerauthor/structure-placebo"
keywords:
  - metaheuristics
  - experimental methodology
  - ablation
  - permutation test
  - swarm intelligence
  - reproducibility
